      <Mandatory>false</Mandatory>
      <Validation></Validation>
      <Description><![CDATA[Necessary cookies help make a website usable by enabling basic functions like page navigation and access to secure areas of the website. The website cannot function properly without these cookies. (Cookiebot is mandatory)]]></Description>
